      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Scott,\n\nI\u0027m helping ayatane@ on the ReAuth project.\n\nWe\u0027d like to check if it\u0027s okay to add a self-contained FIDO2 security key plugin (this CL) to depot_tools, so that `git-credential-luci` can use the plugin for a ReAuth security key challenges.\n\nCommitters will need the plugin after ReAuth rollout. So we think it\u0027s best to distribute the plugin with git-credential-luci (already in depot_tools).",
      "revId": "73903bd29e37482892b35c0a8c2ddd8d0b3387ba",
